      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SW           STOKE MANDEVILLE             RISBOROUGH ROAD                                                 east side 4/138                                           Nos. 29 & 31 (Spencer Cottage) II Pair of Cottages. C18. Red brick, old tile roof with 2 stacks in centre and one to LH. Front has 5 bays, 3 LH bays No.29 with central open lean-to tiled roof porch, 3-light casement each side with segmental arched heads, 2 similar windows to No.31, door to LH, five 2-light casements to 1st floor; all windows with rectangular leaded glazing. 1-storey wing to LH of No. 29, lean-to garage at No. 31. Listing NGR: SP8358410169"
    }
